(ZENTRA X9 5G USER MANUAL) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(GETTING STARTED) Tj T*
(Press and hold the power button on the right side for 3 seconds to turn on the phone.) Tj T*
(Follow the on-screen setup to connect to Wi-Fi and sign in to your account.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CHARGING) Tj T*
(Use the 67 W charger in the box. A full charge from 0 to 100 percent takes about 45) Tj T*
(minutes. Do not charge the phone while it is wet.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(FACTORY RESET) Tj T*
(To erase all data and restore factory settings, open Settings > System > Reset options >) Tj T*
(Erase all data \(factory reset\), then confirm with your screen lock PIN. If the phone does) Tj T*
(not respond, turn it off, then press and hold Power and Volume Down together for 12) Tj T*
(seconds to open recovery mode and choose Wipe data. Back up your data first: a factory) Tj T*
(reset cannot be undone.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SCREEN CARE AND DAMAGE) Tj T*
(The display uses toughened glass but can crack if dropped. Do not use a phone with a) Tj T*
(cracked screen, as glass fragments can cause injury. Report a screen that is cracked on) Tj T*
(arrival within 48 hours of delivery.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(WARRANTY SUPPORT) Tj T*
(The phone has a 1 year manufacturer warranty. For warranty service, raise a support ticket) Tj T*
(in the NovaMart app or visit any NovaMart store with your order number.) Tj T*
